# Probe inputs for the defects of the old Markdown renderer and of streaming.
# Format (parsed by support/corpus.dart): `=== name | flags`, input lines (or one
# `@json "..."` line), `--- expect`, the structure dump.
# Dump grammar: blocks `p h1..h6 code[lang] rule quote alert ul/ol li table th tr`,
# children indented two spaces; inline runs `"text"` with style letters
# b i s c before the quote, `a(url)` for a link, `br`, `img(src)"alt"`.

=== code_in_bold
**`lib/main.dart`**
--- expect
p bc"lib/main.dart"

=== link_with_code_label
[`parse.dart`](https://x.y/z)
--- expect
p a(https://x.y/z)c"parse.dart"

=== nested_emphasis
**bold *it* more**
--- expect
p b"bold " bi"it" b" more"

=== bold_italic_triple
***both***
--- expect
p bi"both"

=== strikethrough
~~gone~~
--- expect
p s"gone"

=== escaped_stars
\*not\*
--- expect
p "*not*"

=== angle_autolink
<https://example.com/a>
--- expect
p a(https://example.com/a)"https://example.com/a"

=== bare_autolink_trailing_dot
see https://example.com/a.
--- expect
p "see " a(https://example.com/a)"https://example.com/a" "."

=== soft_breaks_label_value
Status: ok
Files: 3
--- expect
p "Status: ok\nFiles: 3"

=== soft_breaks_commonmark | soft=space
Status: ok
Files: 3
--- expect
p "Status: ok Files: 3"

=== list_continuation_tight
1. a
   more
2. b
--- expect
ol 1 tight
  li
    p "a\nmore"
  li
    p "b"

=== list_continuation_paragraph_loose
1. a

   more
2. b
--- expect
ol 1 loose
  li
    p "a"
    p "more"
  li
    p "b"

=== fence_in_list_item
- step
  ```sh
  npm i
  ```
- next
--- expect
ul tight
  li
    p "step"
    code[sh] "npm i"
  li
    p "next"

=== nested_list_four_spaces
- a
    - b
- c
--- expect
ul tight
  li
    p "a"
    ul tight
      li
        p "b"
  li
    p "c"

=== task_list
- [ ] todo
- [x] done
--- expect
ul tight
  li [ ]
    p "todo"
  li [x]
    p "done"

=== pipe_table_alignment
| a | b |
|:--|--:|
| 1 | 2 |
--- expect
table l,r
  th "a" | "b"
  tr "1" | "2"

=== setext_h1
Title
=====
--- expect
h1 "Title"

=== setext_h2
Sub
---
--- expect
h2 "Sub"

=== nested_quote_with_list
> a
> > b
> - c
--- expect
quote
  p "a"
  quote
    p "b"
  ul tight
    li
      p "c"

=== html_br
a<br>b
--- expect
p "a" br "b"

=== html_entity
Tom &amp; Jerry
--- expect
p "Tom & Jerry"

=== html_details_is_text
<details>
<summary>More</summary>

body

</details>
--- expect
p "<details>\n<summary>More</summary>"
p "body"
p "</details>"

=== image_block
![alt text](https://x.y/a.png)
--- expect
p img(https://x.y/a.png)"alt text"

=== image_inline
see ![a](b.png) here
--- expect
p "see " img(b.png)"a" " here"

=== fenced_code_language
```dart
void main() {}
```
--- expect
code[dart] "void main() {}"

=== path_with_line_stays_text
Look at lib/a.dart:42 first.
--- expect
p "Look at lib/a.dart:42 first."

=== dunder_is_bold
__init__
--- expect
p b"init"

=== lone_atx_marker
##
--- expect
h2

=== open_fence_with_partial_language
```da
--- expect
code[da] ""

=== unterminated_bold_is_literal
**bo
--- expect
p "**bo"

=== unterminated_code_is_literal
`flutter te
--- expect
p "`flutter te"

=== partial_link_is_literal
[the docs](https://exa
--- expect
p "[the docs](https://exa"

=== quote_then_paragraph
> a

b
--- expect
quote
  p "a"
p "b"

=== alert_warning
> [!WARNING]
> Do not run this as root.
--- expect
alert WARNING
  p "Do not run this as root."

=== inline_code_with_backticks
`` a`b ``
--- expect
p c"a`b"
